Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:03.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think they have yesterday's Daily News?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:03.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得他们有昨天的《每日新闻》吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:05.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Why? - I just wanna check my horoscope...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:05.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 干嘛  - 只是想看我的星座命运…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:07.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...see if it was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:07.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}准不准
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:12.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Phoebe. Don't look now, but, behind you there's a guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:12.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊，菲比，现在别回头看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who has the potential to break our hearts and plunge us into depression.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你背后有个 将会令我们伤心欲绝的帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:17.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:20.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, come to Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:20.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到妈妈怀里来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:23.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, he's coming. Be cool. Be cool. Be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:23.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他来了，酷一点…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Nice hat. BOTH: Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 帽子不错 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:29.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We should do something. Whistle. - We're not gonna whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:29.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们应该有所行动，吹口哨 - 才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:30.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, come on, do it. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:30.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 来吧，吹… - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Do it. Do it. Do it. - Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.10,0:00:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信你居然做出这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S01E11: The One with Mrs. Bing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》 第一季 第11集：宾太太之吻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:56.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：詹妮弗·安妮斯顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:01:00.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：柯特妮·考克斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:03.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：丽莎·库卓）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:10.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马特·勒布朗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.68,0:01:14.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：马修·派瑞）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:18.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（主演：大卫·修蒙）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MONICA: Why did I woo-hoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为什么会叫：呜呼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:33.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, what was I hoping? He'd turn around and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:33.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道我期望 他回过头来然后说：
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:35.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Ooh, I love that sound. I must have you now"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:35.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢那声音，我现在就要你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:38.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wish there was something we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:38.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只希望我们能帮上一点忙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:43.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello. Hello, coma guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:43.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 昏迷的帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get up, you Girl Scout! Up, up, up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}起来  你这娘娘腔 起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:50.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Phoebe, what are you doing? - Maybe nobody's tried this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:50.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 菲比 你在干什么 - 或许没人试过这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.47,0:01:52.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.93,0:01:56.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wish we at least knew his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.93,0:01:56.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望至少能知道他的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:56.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（编剧：艾利·沙强奇）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you look at that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧他这张脸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.35,0:02:02.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, even sleeping he looks smart. I bet he's a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.35,0:02:02.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}即使在昏迷中 他仍一副精明样 我猜他是个律师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:06.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, but did you see the dents in his knuckles? That means he's artistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:06.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有看见他手关节上的凹凸吗  那代表他有艺术气息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:10.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. He's a lawyer who teaches sculpting on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:10.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 他是个兼职教雕塑的律师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:13.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he can dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:13.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且他会跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:13.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（导演：詹姆斯·柏洛斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:17.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And he's the kind of guy who, when you're talking, he's listening...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:17.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是那种静静听你讲话的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:19.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you know, and not saying, "Yeah, I understand"...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:19.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而不是说〝对，我知道〞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:22.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but wondering what you look like naked. - Oh, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.04,0:02:22.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 却想着你裸体的样子  - 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wish all guys could be like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望男生都像他这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:38.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are there no conscious men in the city for you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:38.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道纽约没有适合 你们的清醒男生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:43.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He doesn't have anyone. - Yeah. We feel kind of responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:43.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 他身旁没人照顾 - 我们觉得应该负起责任
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you said, "Woo-hoo."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不敢相信你会喊：呜呼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:48.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't even say, "Woo-hoo."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:48.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连我都不说〝呜呼〞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:50.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, she's coming up. She's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:50.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔，她出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:51.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Folks, when we come back...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.77,0:02:51.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}稍后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:54.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we'll talk about her new book Euphoria Unbound...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:54.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们将和风趣的 诺拉泰勒宾来聊一聊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.19,0:02:57.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with always-interesting Nora Tyler Bing. Put the kids to bed for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.19,0:02:57.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的新书《无边的快感》 你得叫你的孩子上床睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't watch this. Weekend at Bernie's is on Showtime and HBO and Cinemex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们别看这个 其他电视台有《柏尼斯之周末夜》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:04.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No way. - Come on. She's your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:04.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不行 - 拜托，她是你妈妈耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exactly. Weekend at Bernie's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以才要看《柏尼斯之周末夜》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dead guy getting hit in the groin 20, 30 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}死人的裤裆部分被打几十次 很有看头
