Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:12.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不看吗 - 钱德，我得告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:15.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I love your mom's books. I love her books.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:15.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱你妈写的书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I cannot get on a plane without one. I mean, this is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:18.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}飞机上不能没有她的书陪伴 她的书太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:20.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You wouldn't think it's cool if you were 11...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:20.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你无法想像当你11岁的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:24.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and all your friends were passing around page 79 of Mistress Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:24.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的朋友们争相传阅 第79页《情妇婊子》时的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:28.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Chandler. I love your mom. I think she's a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:28.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托，钱德，我超爱你妈的 她一级棒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:31.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You can say that. She's not your mom. ROSS: Oh, please. She's the...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.19,0:03:31.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你这么说是因为她不是你妈 - 拜托，她是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Hi, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When did Rigatoni get back from Rome?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个意大利通心粉 什么时候从罗马回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Last night. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 昨晚  - 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:44.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So then his plane didn't explode in a big ball of fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:44.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道他的飞机 没在空中炸成火球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a dream I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是我做的一个梦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:48.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:48.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, hey, hey. She's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.54,0:03:51.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿…她上节目了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:55.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah. Nora Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:55.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}诺拉宾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:58.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before we get to the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.01,0:03:58.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下再谈你的书吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:01.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is this about you being arrested in London? What is that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:01.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听说你在伦敦被逮捕？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.89,0:04:06.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Your mom was arrested? - Shh, I'm busy beaming with pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.89,0:04:06.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你妈被逮捕  - 嘘，我正在深感骄傲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is kind of embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说来有点难为情…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:12.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but occasionally after I've been intimate with a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:12.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时我在和一个男人亲热后…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:16.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Why would she say that's embarrassing? - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:16.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她怎会说难为情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:19.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I just get this craving for Kung Pao chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:19.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我非常想吃宫保鸡丁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's too much information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}透露太多了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So now you're doing this book tour thing. How's that going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在你正为新书做宣传 情况如何
