Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:01.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You going to the hospital tonight? - No. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:01.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你今晚要去医院吗  - 没有 你呢
