Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:18.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好火热
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:22.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And here's a picture of my mother and father on their wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:22.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我爸妈在婚礼时照的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:25.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, you tell me she's not a knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:25.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你告诉我，她是不是个美女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I cannot believe we're having this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没想到我们会谈论这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:31.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, just try to picture her not pregnant. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:31.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就试着想像她没挺着大肚子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:37.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Central Perk is proud to present Miss Phoebe Buffay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:37.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}中央咖啡厅很荣幸 为各位介绍菲比布非小姐
