Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.38,0:15:42.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. Um, ahem. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.38,0:15:42.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨，好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:46.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'd like to start with a song that's about a man I recently met...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:46.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这首歌是有关一个我刚认识的男生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who's, um, come to be very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他已成为我生命中重要的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:53.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:53.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:59.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have to be awake To be my man
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:59.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你无须醒来当我的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:07.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Long as you have brain waves I'll be there to hold your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:07.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要你一息尚存 我就会在一旁守候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Though we just met the other day
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我们相遇不久
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:14.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's something I have got to say
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:14.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想说…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:18.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, thank you very much. I'm gonna take a short break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:18.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢各位，我得休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:24.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RACHEL: Okay, that was Phoebe Buffay, everybody. Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:24.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感谢菲比布非小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:28.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What the hell was that? - Phoebe just started...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:28.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 她在搞什么东西 - 菲比刚刚…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:32.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I believe I was talking to Joey. All right, there, mother-kisser?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:32.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是和乔伊讲话，亲老妈的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:39.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Mother-kisser."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.52,0:16:39.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝亲老妈的人〞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, can I say something? I know you're still mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德，我知道你仍在生我的气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:48.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wanna say that there were two people there that night, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:48.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想说那一夜有两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- There were two sets of lips. - Yes, well, I expect this from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 两双嘴唇 - 是，我希望她亲口告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:54.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay? She's always been a Freudian nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她一直都是个佛洛依德梦魇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, but if she always behaves like this, why don't you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她一直这样 你为何不找她谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because it's complicated. It's complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:17:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为太复杂了，一团乱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you kissed my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你亲了我妈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're rehearsing a Greek play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们正在排练希腊剧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That's funny. We done now? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 真幽默 排练完了吗  - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:15.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you mean you're not gonna talk to her, tell her how you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:15.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不找她谈 不说出你的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That would be a no. Just because you played tonsil tennis with my mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.31,0:17:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，别以为你亲过她
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:21.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...doesn't mean you know her, all right? Trust me, you can't talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.77,0:17:21.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就自以为了解她 相信我，不能找她谈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. "You can't"? Or you can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到底是能还是不能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:30.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, that's my finger. Okay, that's my knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:30.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，这是我的手指 好，这是我的膝盖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:32.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still doing the play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:32.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还在排练
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:41.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, what did you do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:41.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好，你对他怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:48.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're awake. - Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:48.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你醒了 - 瞧瞧你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:49.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:49.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:52.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, a little woozy, but basically okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:52.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}头有点晕，基本上还行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gosh, you look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的气色好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.89,0:17:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我感觉好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:17:59.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:17:59.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Sorry. - I'm Phoebe Buffay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对不起 - 我叫菲比布非
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:03.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Monica Geller. I've been taking care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我叫摩妮卡盖勒 我一直在照顾你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:04.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We both have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:04.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们一直在照顾你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So the Etch A Sketch is from you guys? - Actually, it's just from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 雕刻艺术品是你们送的？ - 其实只有我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.15,0:18:11.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, I got you the foot massager. - Know who shaved you? That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.15,0:18:11.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我替你做脚底按摩 - 知道是谁帮你刮胡子的吗？是我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:14.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I read to you. - I sang. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:14.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我念书给你听 - 我唱歌给你听
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:19.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Oh, my pleasure. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:19.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我的荣幸 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:22.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I guess I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:22.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想那就再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:25.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.92,0:18:25.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"See you around"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:27.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝再见〞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:31.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, what do you want me to say? - Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:31.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 不然要我说什么 - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe, uh:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:32.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许该说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"That was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝你真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It meant something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这对我来讲意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:39.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll call you."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:39.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会打电话给你〞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:43.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right. I'll call you. - I don't think you mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:43.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好吧，我会打给你 - 一点诚意都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is so typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}典型的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.69,0:18:49.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, we give...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.69,0:18:49.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们付出
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and we give...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}付出
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:53.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and we give.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:53.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不断的付出
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:55.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then we just get nothing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.32,0:18:55.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}却得不到任何回报
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:59.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then one day, it's just, you know, you wake up and "See you around."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.78,0:18:59.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一天他醒来却只说〝再见〞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's go, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走吧，菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:08.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? We thought you were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.42,0:19:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道吗？我们以为你与众不同
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:10.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I guess it was just the coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:10.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我想这只是昏迷的缘故
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}NORA: The car's running downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}楼下的车已发动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:19.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wanted to drop off these copies of my book for your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:19.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想拿几本我的书给你朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:24.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Anything you want from Lisbon? - No, just knowing you're there is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:24.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 需要我在里斯本帮你买什么吗 - 不需要 知道你要去就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:28.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. Well, be good. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:28.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧，要乖哦，我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You kissed my best Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你亲了我最好的罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or something to that effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好像说错了，反正差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.87,0:19:40.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:46.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, it was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:46.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我做了蠢事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:49.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Really stupid. - Really stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:49.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 愚蠢至极 - 愚蠢至极
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I don't even know how it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:53.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不知道是怎么发生的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, honey. I promise it will never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉，孩子，我保证不会再发生这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:02.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Are we okay now? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.84,0:20:02.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我们没事吧 - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.93,0:20:05.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.93,0:20:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah, the forbidden love of a man and his door.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男人与门之间禁忌的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:17.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He did it. He told her off. And not just about the kiss, about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:17.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说了，不只是亲吻的事 一切都说出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:18.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You're kidding? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.78,0:20:18.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:21.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He said, "When are you gonna grow up and start being a mom?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:21.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说〝你何时才能成熟 开始有个妈的样子〞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:23.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Wow. - Wait, then she came back with:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:23.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，她回答说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:28.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"The question is, when are you gonna grow up and realize I have a bomb?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:28.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝问题是：你何时才能长大 了解我有大屁股？〞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:32.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, wait. Are you sure she didn't say:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:32.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，你确定她不是说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:36.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"When are you gonna grow up and realize I am your mom?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:36.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}〝你何时才能长大 了解我是你妈〞吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- That makes more sense. - You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 这样比较说得通 - 你也这样认为吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:45.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what's going on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:45.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在情况怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:49.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. I've been standing here spelling it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:49.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 我一直在这里说给你听
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't hear anything. Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我什么都听不到，等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:54.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:54.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看见什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:57.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's hard to tell. They're so tiny and upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.02,0:20:57.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很难说，他们好小而且上下颠倒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:20:58.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:20:58.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等，等等
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:02.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're walking away. They're walking away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:02.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们走过来，他们走过去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, they're not. They're coming right at us. Run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不，不是 他们走过来了，快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You okay, kiddo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.83,0:21:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吧，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:13.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah, I'm okay. - All right. You be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.12,0:21:13.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 还好 - 当个乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Drive safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小心开车
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Mrs. Bing. - Mr. Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你好，宾太太 - 你好，盖勒先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:26.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:26.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:29.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:29.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你当真？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 有何不可
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:36.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So I told her. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:36.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉她了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How did it go? - Awful. Awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 情况怎么样 - 简直太糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:40.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Couldn't have gone worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:40.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有比这更糟糕的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:44.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Well, how do you feel? - Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:44.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 感觉怎样 - 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:47.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:47.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉她了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧，看到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:54.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So maybe it wasn't such a bad idea, you know, me kissing your mom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:54.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我亲你妈不是个坏主意…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:57.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we don't have to go down that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:57.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我们不必继续往下说了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, this is just the first chapter...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是第一章
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I want your absolute honest opinion. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要大家坦白的意见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:15.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and on page two, he's not reaching for her "heaving beasts."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.35,0:22:15.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在第二页中他的手没伸向 她那〝尖挺“的双峰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:18.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's a "niffle"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.02,0:22:18.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么是〝乳投〞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can usually find them on the heaving beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在尖挺的双峰上可以找到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:25.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, all right, so I'm not a great typist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.40,0:22:25.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧…算我不会打字
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.82,0:22:29.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, did you get to the part about his "huge, throbbing pens"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.82,0:22:29.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有看到这句吗 〝他这只巨大、跳动的笔〞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:33.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell you, you don't wanna be around when he starts writing with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他写作时你可得离远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.17,0:22:37.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right, that's it. Give them back. GROUP: No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.17,0:22:37.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 好了，别看了，还给我 - 不
